  "description": "Held-out retrieval evaluation set, labelled against Flask 3.1.3 (pallets/flask). Written before any configuration was run on this repository, so no setting was tuned against it. Questions avoid quoting identifiers. Fetch the corpus with: git clone --depth 1 --branch 3.1.3 https://github.com/pallets/flask data/eval_repos/flask",
  "labelling_notes": [
    "expected_files lists every file that legitimately answers the question.",
